                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Description of the genetic, genomic, or molecular examination performed to find a variant."@en .


###  http://irst.emr.it/cvl/first_administration_date
:first_administration_date rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
