                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The end date when a patient received their final dose of a specific line of therapy."@en .


###  http://irst.emr.it/cvl/line_of_therapy_value
:line_of_therapy_value rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
